{"title":"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Short_Cut\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Short Cut</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Sidenote\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sidenote</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(whee!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (whee!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The arithmetic mean of two distinct positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a two-digit integer. The geometric mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is obtained by reversing the digits of the arithmetic mean. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c0a86663edb0dccee099a47d48b1b19a4ee6cb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/7113ac762caf217fd361fbfb21c730f16b918fc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 54 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 66 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Answer: (D)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/342e669c5f982921510eed5990165058204fe3c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x + y}{2} = 10 a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"128\" height=\"35\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/21706f6d7bd91de80b7907e39e93716c6a52ffb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le a\\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e00f24846ce303d725c578b544695249bddd1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le b\\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5dfb99b9325e1a558580a99ca460757e4b7eb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{xy} = 10 b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Squaring the first and second equations, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca85bbd49bb30b10b5dcc1a3d4d69dfb2c23224b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2 + 2xy + y^2}{4}=100 a^2 + 20 ab + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"278\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/0085dd68b349b5c40cc868bee99b36fa2425061b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 100b^2 + 20ab + a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the previous two equations, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de78275ca54933bcd4e3b2c8821fbd1ddc7dcb76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2 + 2xy + y^2}{4} - xy = \\frac{x^2 - 2xy + y^2}{4} = \\left(\\frac{x-y}{2}\\right)^2 = 99 a^2 - 99 b^2 = 99(a^2 - b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f0ea020cf911fd729950f156f8092c4e00885e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = 2\\sqrt{99(a^2 - b^2)}=6\\sqrt{11(a^2 - b^2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"328\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Note that for x-y to be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/5/af55ef3efb75660e1eed740749565b7a8e42e9b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^2 - b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" /> has to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8fb94bc1d984fa0e967f0b77d4db5e754ed122c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> for some perfect square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c766f9fce6070981e62f805a7cf7294baed4498e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c766f9fce6070981e62f805a7cf7294baed4498e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b303c12fc9d4db885f2c06a6933c5ff100bb27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = 66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5218af40079081e694d8b82eeac2d368ef6ea76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5afd2cfc4ae679d9c5369dc9f52e0accc198907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = 132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />. In AMC, we are done. Otherwise, we need to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/d/42d1a8a23f35e20b35017fa741618ed859022905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 -b^2 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" /> is impossible.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/26480ca4b9eb7af3e430e124d4bfe5d2d6681b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)(a+b) = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" /> -&gt; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2ea7581c87e299152333019e7f838260fcefbe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/689ff6d70f0963c7d5592caee0fa05ff9768dcef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. And since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea6df4d5b93ac3cfadfffd1d26d1cda4a121c4ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b \\le 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab0940a9cbb5562898f5e0a9049f31e0516f4e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a06c23e5af123b80b7c95fa562313cac7c4cd3a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, but there is no integer solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Short_Cut\">Short Cut</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Short Cut\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can arrive at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3808440d238bbf65c6f84db700ae3d8e631d3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = 6\\sqrt{11(a^2 - b^2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"192\" height=\"35\" /> using the method above. Because we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e526fbac5ee18e20a7293e9cb9c317989b31988a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> is an integer, it must be a multiple of 6 and 11. Hence the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e540df2be5d0f86905d68f2b28ba1f8fcc6f67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$66.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>In addition:\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8fb94bc1d984fa0e967f0b77d4db5e754ed122c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c766f9fce6070981e62f805a7cf7294baed4498e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> may be obtained with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/5/65542e7e189df28226e40f039153e3439ccace0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2 = 36 - 25 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"178\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sidenote\">Sidenote</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Sidenote\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is easy to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba37a4f7fe90fe6a04c3d35c232b7e6bea9feb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(6,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> is the only solution. This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2acbb28f1ba53b87f9e59ae65c78097f113a4170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)=(98,32)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />. Their arithmetic mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339baf6df71777af266e6259546917b0742caf2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and their geometric mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a7cb720e9fc1a250b277e8cd88d2225a4f57a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)/2 = 10a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/4/194c493b95b417f9f6d1fe135daec0baa567d96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{xy} = 10b + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />. By AM-GM we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/18786649350a0a7e257fb57a375eb1093d51a225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Squaring and multiplying by 4 on the first equation we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/e/29eed4fd215324d23a044116cb15f3c929f4c2f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 + 2xy = 400a^2 + 4b^2 + 80ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"283\" height=\"20\" />. Squaring and multiplying the second equation by 4 we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390b2a5a36bc52ecf995bbe51981a312eea4debc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4xy = 400b^2 + 4a^2 + 80ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />. Subtracting we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae62ee3c9e588d40daeceb616fd0f2fa864dbde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2 = 396(a^2 - b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"21\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c93dbdc11469e48b455f6b1171908b9cb5acea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$396 = 2^2 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />. So to make it a perfect square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/3721f47a8780121bf279d325fc6608c1856bd656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />. From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e05cb23011a37aa28294d54b4332698d4b506a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 11 = 66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />. \n~coolmath_2018\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28whee.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(whee!)\">Solution 3 (whee!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (whee!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the 2 digit number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c8b0d985d7137b67edcdd55029a03843223fe5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />. We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bb4767359d0adb8d6c4a50ac86b56b2ba6c3265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=20a+2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c58aa6608cb1ee9e37686faaa1c884f462dbee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{xy} = 10b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThus. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45387e7c86797d362ac45e861a641656fc4e3ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2xy+y^2 = 400a^2+80ab+4b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"283\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4adab549c976507b67b8d72e3f6df51dd9a7ba68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 100b^2+20ab+a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42efcb46f602cbf777797d3666f658a02cb86cd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = \\sqrt{(x-y)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"35\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3220da0ef4c1d2afc0accb3ccfc9e30ea19889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2 = (x+y)^2-4xy = 396a^2-396b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"338\" height=\"21\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3e48b9981834dd27c66e9037c375d298addd8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y| = 6\\sqrt{11}\\cdot \\sqrt{b^2-a^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"24\" />. Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e526fbac5ee18e20a7293e9cb9c317989b31988a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> must be a multiple of 11, so the only possible answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c069a08ba07cec393017d3dee7e96773f037e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }66}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-skibbysiggy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B\">2011 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\